      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Hey there! I hope you’re ready for a little fun—because I’m here to update my address and maybe crack a smile or two. I just moved from sunny Florida to Phoenix (talk about trading hurricanes for heatwaves!). My account still has my old address, but you can find my new one in my most recent order—no peeking at my old zip code, please! \n\nAlso, I’m on a quest for the cheapest t-shirt you’ve got. Can you tell me the price, and is it possible to order it through you? I promise not to make any “shirt” puns… okay, maybe just one or two!",
