      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Absolutely—I can help with both.\n\n### 1) Update your address (needs authentication)\nTo access your account, please reply with **either**:\n- your **email address**, **or**\n- your **first name, last name, and ZIP code** (for verification)\n\nOnce I can find your account, I can use your **most recent order** to pull your new address (and I won’t rely on your old ZIP), then I’ll ask you to confirm before updating anything.\n\n### 2) Cheapest t-shirt price\nAfter authentication, I can look up the **t-shirt product options and identify the lowest available price**.\n\nQuick note: I can provide the pricing and product details, but I can’t directly place a new order on your behalf from here—if you tell me the option you want, I can guide you on what to select.\n\nReply with your **email** to start.",
